  "notes": "1450 Owens Street -- a 7-story, ~1-acre laboratory/office building at the Alexandria Center for Science and Technology's Mission Bay Megacampus, completed/came online 2024 (133,000 sq ft lab space, ~50,000 sq ft office, 2,600 sq ft ground-level retail per Commercial Property Executive/EurekAlert coverage of the building). Owner-identified while reviewing the numbered real-gap-fragment map for this session's positioning check. Gladstone Institutes (whose own separate headquarters at 1650 Owens St, blklot 8709008, is already tracked) signed a 105,000+ sq ft lease here in 2024 for its data science and genomic immunology institutes, per Gladstone's own press release and multiple real-estate trade press reports -- this record tracks the real Alexandria-owned building/parcel, not a separate Gladstone-owned site. DataSF Assessor confirms blklot 8709017 at 1450 Owens St; the DataSF Building Footprints layer only captures small roof fragments (~688 sq m total) of this real ~4,607 sq m parcel, so this record uses the real Assessor parcel boundary directly, consistent with how this project handles other footprint-layer gaps (e.g. 1300 Fourth Street, Block 6E).",
